<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC set to leave quotas unchanged - Gulf source.</title>
<headline>OPEC set to leave quotas unchanged - Gulf source.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC is virtually certain to keep its production ceiling unchanged when it meets on Wednesday, a senior Gulf source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be a rollover, I can tell you 99 percent that is the case,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
